id: pm-brief-v4n0
title: The delta budget docstring stated the wrong fallback for a non-positive maxItems
description: "The parameter doc claimed non-finite or non-positive maxItems falls back to 40. The implementation floors any finite value at 1 and only substitutes 40 when the value is non-finite, so a caller implementing the documented boundary would expect 40 items where the code yields 1. Corrected the doc to describe both paths separately."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
