completed_at: "2026-08-09T12:57:47.752Z"
author: claude
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "The parameter documentation matches Math.max(1, Math.floor(isFinite ? maxItems : 40))."
actual_result: Docstring rewritten to state both branches; no behavior change.
close_reason: "Documented the two paths separately: non-finite falls back to 40, any finite value is floored at 1."
